{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming adventures with your friends. Explore snowy landscapes, play mini-games, and express yourself in the cutest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/01-ENG.png?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waddle through snowy villages, slide down icy hills, or give your friends a playful slap to send them tumbling. It\u2019s all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-01.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/02-ENG.png?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast your line and relax as you fish in icy waters. Catch rare creatures, fill your journal, and earn rewards along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-02.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/03-ENG.png?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock outfits, colors, hats, and accessories to create your own unique penguin style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-03.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/04-ENG.png?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends in fast-paced soccer matches, chaotic Push It brawls, or test your skills in dizzying vertical platforming trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-04.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/05-ENG.png?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather around the campfire, dance, emote, or just vibe with friends in a warm and snowy social hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-05.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617840?t=1745769182","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/f0fbdb131c5e9f0a71d4c90d53d8a5b320045077/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745769182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/2284c137cfd250ae5bab687c047791ec0bb6324c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745769182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/2284c137cfd250ae5bab687c047791ec0bb6324c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745769182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Game About Penguins</strong> is a cozy, online multiplayer sandbox where you play as a customizable penguin and dive into hilarious, heartwarming ad