ical platforming trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-04.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/05-ENG.png?t=1745769182\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather around the campfire, dance, emote, or just vibe with friends in a warm and snowy social hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/extras/Gif-05.gif?t=1745769182\" /></p>","developers":["CO's Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617840/602c7c9252179a03392c302b3481046a49e1b2f1/header.jpg?t=1745769182","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126835,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126835/movie480.mp4?t=1745614918","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126835/movie_max.mp4?t=1745614918"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126835/c192374884b3a852f1bab681cd7ca79a0ad57473/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745614918","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126835/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745614918","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126835/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745614918"}}],"name":"A Game About Penguins","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB R